<title>UK: Woolwich B/S buys back 106 mln stg of 2001 bonds.</title>
<headline>Woolwich B/S buys back 106 mln stg of 2001 bonds.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Woolwich Building Society has bought back 105.63 million stg of its 11.625 percent subordinated bond issue due December 2001, Merrill Lynch International said on Wednesday as arranger.</p>
<p>The bonds will be cancelled to leave 94.37 million stg outstanding.</p>
<p>-- Dan Lalor, London newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
